\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces One session of the capacity-accounted arm (39 rounds, 17 suspensions), first hour. Each bar is a round, coloured by how much of its prefix the engine had to recompute; grey spans are suspensions. The lower panel is the engine's running-request count: while the session is suspended the card keeps serving other sessions, which is the slot the suspension buys. A round that follows a suspension is usually red---the state did not survive---which is the cost side of the same decision.}}{7}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:timeline}{{2}{7}{One session of the capacity-accounted arm (39 rounds, 17 suspensions), first hour. Each bar is a round, coloured by how much of its prefix the engine had to recompute; grey spans are suspensions. The lower panel is the engine's running-request count: while the session is suspended the card keeps serving other sessions, which is the slot the suspension buys. A round that follows a suspension is usually red---the state did not survive---which is the cost side of the same decision}{figure.caption.6}{}}
